<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cooper Cameron Corp cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cooper Cameron Corp cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jefferies &amp; Co Inc analyst Sam Albright said he cut his rating on Cooper Cameron Corp to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Cooper Cameron shares were 3/8 lower at 74-5/8 in morning trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
